      <description>
        <![CDATA[
          <h2>What's New in Version 0.23.27</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Fixed AMFI errors by removing get-task-allow entitlement</li>
            <li>App now works on all user machines without provisioning profile</li>
            <li>Maintained all essential entitlements (allow-jit, disable-library-validation, keychain-access-groups)</li>
          </ul>
          <p>For detailed release notes, visit: <a href="https://github.com/BizCrush/BizCrush/releases/tag/v0.23.27">Release Notes</a></p>
